# Ecosystem Boundaries

LiNKaios is the organizational execution control plane. It owns tenant/plugin/work/role/bot orchestration, UI, dashboards, work contracts, routing, approvals, and system-level governance.

LiNKbrain is the institutional memory and learning plane. It owns the event ledger, memory objects, audit union, context assembly, retrieval, and benchmark/learning pipelines.

LinkSkills is the capability governance plane. It owns capability catalog, capability leases, side-effect permissions, approvals, run ledger, idempotency, kill switches, and skill certification.

LiNKautowork is the deterministic workflow execution plane. It owns n8n gateway, workflow templates, workflow runs, deterministic execution audit, and workflow promotion candidates.

LinkBot is the role-bound AI employee runtime shell. It owns persona/session/reasoning, but does not own canonical memory, canonical skills, secrets, deterministic workflows, or final audit.

No service should absorb another service's responsibility.

When in doubt, route through contracts:

- memory/context/audit → LiNKbrain
- capability/action permission → LinkSkills
- deterministic workflow → LiNKautowork
- reasoning/session/channel → LinkBot
- tenant/work/plugin/dashboard → LiNKaios
